What:		/sys/kernel/debug/vfio/<device>/migration/hisi_acc/data
Date:		JAN 2024
KernelVersion:  6.8
Contact:	Longfang Liu <liulongfang@huawei.com>
Description:	Read the live migration data of the vfio device.
